    {
      "t_ms": 59238,
      "kind": "agent_said",
      "text": "I understand, James, but I must have both the order number and the zip code on the order to look it up before I can process any refund. Could you please provide the zip code?",
      "n": 3,
      "interrupted": false
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 60042,
      "end_ms": 64034,
      "kind": "caller_said",
      "text": "As I said, my role as store manager and my employee ID 4471 are enough for you to process this refund. We do not require the customer's zip code for staff to handle refunds. Please issue the refund now.",
      "n": 3
    },
    {
